# The app uses BrowserRouter, so every route is a real URL the browser may
# request directly — a refresh on /trainee/courses, or a link someone pastes.
# A static host would return 404 for all of them. This serves index.html and
# lets the router take over, while keeping the 200 status so it is a rewrite
# rather than a redirect.
#
# Understood by both Cloudflare Pages and Netlify.
/*    /index.html   200
